      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 29ec680a7813314dd764909dec3c673607f6f301\nparent 246d812de9bde8453540636e8f059137f85cb4fb\nauthor Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1785805489 -0700\ncommitter Lőrinc <pap.lorinc@gmail.com> 1785820901 -0700\n\np2p: enforce relay limit for BIP35 requesters\n\nWhen a node offers `NODE_BLOOM`, an inbound peer advertising `fRelay=false` can request mempool inventory while remaining outside inbound transaction-relay capacity.\n\nEnforce the limit when an inbound peer first requests BIP35 mempool inventory, avoiding repeated scans of all connections on subsequent requests.\nKeep `fRelay=false` effective for ongoing transaction announcements.\nSkip the response when capacity eviction selects the requester.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQQiU97U54YbP0PlTVgnCd/LLYEwhwUCanF25RsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQJwnfyy2BMIczpwD+KT+xOr91FvVrGxXUgFEb\nMebXHJaYtasX8b5TNVyaYOABAJLy4iYr6dAQj2ill7x97fFVUZeqCgSppLcKHi8i\nVHsO\n=PkSy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
